        }
      ],
      "message": "test: add p2p_inbound_reconnect.py\n\nCover both paths of the reconnect check with -maxconnections=13 (two\ninbound slots, one of them for tx relay): a reconnecting address is\naccepted while a slot is free, dropped at accept time when the inbound\nslots are full, dropped after version (and after filterload) when the\ntx-relay slot is taken, forgotten after two windows, and treated as\nbefore without the test-only option that includes local addresses in\nthe check.\n\nWith two inbound slots nothing is ever evictable, so p2p_eviction.py is\nextended to run its 21-peer setup a second time with the check applied\nto local addresses: the peer that triggered an eviction before is now\ndropped instead, and all other peers stay connected.",
      "committer": {
        "name": "0xb10c",
        "email": "github@b10c.me",
        "date": "2026-10-17T15:31:12Z"
      },
